{
  "description": "Glance wakes (eink-ha-os#10, emulator src/core/glance.ts, firmware core/glance.cpp). snapshotDiff: region key -> hash maps (prev null = no valid snapshot in RTC), ignore = clock regions; result sorted. glanceStep: what a wake does with its result (unreachable: changed = what the face shows without new data, eink-ha-os#356). wifiFast: how to reconnect from the RTC Wi-Fi cache. liveNow: live mode after a key press. arm: first-boot safety per firmware version, armed after ARM_BOOTS = 3 confirmed boots with network or (eink-ha-os#231) ARM_UPTIME_MIN = 30 min of one boot with network and a confirmed image (stored = null: none; ops count = this boot confirmed; then up = [netUpMin, otaPendingVerify] when present; by = armedBy). tally (eink-ha-os#178): wake counters since power-on in RTC memory, ops in order from zero: [\"wake\", sleptAtEpoch, wakeAtEpoch, nowEpoch] (slept = clock when known and not backwards, else planned timer, else 0), [\"glance\", ok, redraw, wifiMs|null, haMs|null, totalMs], [\"sleep\", awakeMs, fullRefreshes, partialRefreshes]. timer (eink-ha-os#364): sleep-timer drift. ppm = timerPpm(prev, programmedS, realS) (learned from timer sleeps >= TIMER_LEARN_MIN_S = 3600 s; |ppm| > TIMER_PPM_MAX = 50000 or realS 0 keeps prev; rounded half up), seconds = timerSeconds(realS, ppm) (>= 1, rounded half up), early = earlyWake(wakeAtEpoch, nowEpoch) (0 = unknown; up to EARLY_WAIT_S = 15 s early waits awake, earlier sleeps again).",
